  "rules": {
    "R07-03aa": "Human shelf: after operator gift copy30 card pool bytes, draw rand%10+6 slots. Each weighted draw removes one from local copy only (duplicates allowed); no global reservation. Tool list scans1..8 positive supply in numeric order with one slot per type. Buy clears clicked card/tool slot. Sale changes bag/pool but no shelf repopulation; re-entry rebuilds current pool. No periodic restock in this path.",
    "R12-03aa": "Shop6001 company operator byte+18 equals current seat+1: before human/AI branch random low bit chooses tool(odd)/card(even). No check of merely holding shares or company funds. Applies Japan50/107 stop only, dream skips nonzero event; passing does not enter. Gift then falls through normal shop, no points/cash/company income.44f230 is character speech, not a fee.",
    "R07-04aa": "Random card chooses from all30 remaining counts then receiveCard; full15 replaces first cheapest slot and returns discard. Random tool chooses among first8 counts then receiveTool; selected bag count>=9 grants nothing, consumes no pool and does not retry. Empty category returns0; no fallback to other category. Research/worker9..13 excluded from this gift/shelf.",
    "R07-05aa": "Manual buy needs affordable points, card count<15 or selected tool count<9, consumes one available visit slot plus one global pool unit; purchase return10*base price continues v39 close ledger. Gifted last unit is absent when building shelf; used/sold items only become candidates for a subsequent visit.",
    "R13-13aa": "Web serializes visit shelf slots+gift receipt in shop decision; commands guarded by existing actor/pause/revision/token. Same item duplicate slots consume first available because identity and price are equal. Current seeded v12 range sampler retained; no native UI/voice rand reproduction. Depleted total<requested safely caps shelf instead of native weighted loop modulo0. G7 inventory/ledger restored but RNG/history rules remain inherited."
  },
  "limits": {
    "cardShelfRequested": [
      6,
      15
    ],
    "cardKinds": 30,
    "toolKinds": 8,
    "cardCapacity": 15,
    "perToolCapacity": 9
  },
  "deferred": [
    "native random generator, UI animation/voice draws and AI branch",
    "special actors",
    "minigames6/7/8",
    "other asset listings",
    "native roulette/post-exit stack/ending"
  ],
  "candidateDifferences": [
    "cap shelf to remaining card total when native weighted loop would reach zero",
    "empty gift message safely handles native itemID0 display indexing",
    "same-item card slots grouped in Web UI with explicit remaining count",
    "legacy seeded RNG and non-shop acquisition differences retained"
  ]
